From ae820eb6d8559a08a89195ef129581b27821d9b4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: fi3 <you@example.com>
Date: Wed, 24 Jun 2026 01:30:26 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] ADD strict selected-agent slash command execution so
 backend commands bypass ordinary prompts

Selected agent chat routes real slash command tokens through the provider command path, preserving ordinary prompt handling for non-command text. Codex resumes the existing thread with raw command stdin so Codex CLI slash commands keep their native semantics.
---
